R/differentiation_stats.R, function .jost_hsht()
-------------------------------------------------
The five-step formula in .jost_hsht() (harmN -> HpS -> Hs_est -> HpT ->
Ht_est) is adapted from the HsHt() function of the mmod R package
(R/HsHt.R), reimplemented against this package's H$A1/H$A2 integer-
genotype matrices in place of mmod's genind-object representation. This
is an adaptation of mmod's expression of the formula, not an independent
re-derivation from Jost (2008).

